### Login (Admin)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tapg.local",
  "password": "password"
}

### Get Profile (replace TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Accept: application/json

### List Assets
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/assets?per_page=10
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Accept: application/json

### Create Work Order
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/work-orders
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "asset_id": 1,
  "type": "preventive",
  "priority": "medium",
  "title": "Service berkala 250 HM",
  "description": "Sample create WO dari api-sample.http",
  "supervisor_id": 3,
  "scheduled_start": "2026-05-19 08:00:00",
  "scheduled_end": "2026-05-19 12:00:00",
  "checklist": ["Cek oli", "Cek filter"]
}

### Submit P2H
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/p2h
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "asset_id": 1,
  "template_id": 1,
  "geolat": -6.2,
  "geolng": 106.8,
  "items": [
    {"item_name": "Cek oli mesin", "condition": "ok", "notes": "aman"},
    {"item_name": "Cek alarm mundur", "condition": "ok"}
  ]
}

### Scramble API Docs
GET http://localhost:8000/docs/api
